Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 07:46:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Send one WhatsApp image message per product for
 recommend_products browses (task #214)

- Add format_recommendation_caption() to response_formatter.py: a
  compact two-line caption (name, then karat/price pairs joined with
  ' | ', collapsing to a price range past the existing 3-variant cap)
  shared by both the WhatsApp send path and the /demo cards.
- whatsapp_routes.py: a genuine browse (recommend_products returning
  more than one product) now sends one image+caption message per
  product, capped at 4, using the same category-diversified selection
  already used for last_presented_products. Items without a photo, or
  a failed send, fall back to one trailing text message rather than
  being dropped. Audio input is unaffected -- still one spoken reply.
  Previously this path sent text only, zero photos, for every browse.
- demo_routes.py: _build_recommendation_cards() now reuses the same
  caption formatter so /demo mirrors the real WhatsApp reply exactly.
- Tests for the new formatter and the new WhatsApp branch (multi-image
  send, cap at 4, no-photo fallback, send-failure fallback, audio
  priority unaffected). Full suite: 703 passed, 29 skipped.
